\section{程序运行说明}
{\sloppy
依 序运行 \texttt{preprocess.py}（附件检验）、\texttt{tests\_engine.py}（引擎校验）、
\texttt{q1\_solve.py}、\texttt{q2\_solve.py}（coarse、southcut、explore2、refine、final 五阶段）、
\texttt{q2\_outputs.py}、\texttt{q2\_lhs.py}、\texttt{q2\_lhs\_narrow.py}、\texttt{q2\_refine2.py}（随机采样互证与细步精化）、\texttt{q3\_solve.py}（solve、final）、\texttt{q3\_outputs.py}、
\texttt{global\_checks.py}、\texttt{paper\_assets.py}。环境：Python 3.12，numpy、scipy、numba、pandas、matplotlib、openpyxl。单次全场评估约 1.4$\sim$2 s（$K=12$）与 4.8$\sim$5 s（$K=24$，随镜数而异），全部结果可完整复现。\par}


\section{核心代码说明}
评估核（节选，完整代码见支撑材料）：
\begin{verbatim}
# occlusion: subcell-center ray vs neighbor-mirror rectangle
#   shadow: along s;   blocking: along r_i
for j in neighbors(i):
    tau = ((M_j - p) . n_j) / (d . n_j)
    if tau > 0 and |u| <= w_j/2 and |v| <= h_j/2:  cell lost
# truncation: cone (sigma = L*theta_odot) vs receiver box
eta_trunc = sum_k Area(Ds cap (T - x_k)) / (K^2*pi*sig^2)
# efficiency chain and field output
eta_i = 0.92 * (s.n_i) * eta_sb_i * eta_trunc_i * eta_at(d_HR)
E_field(t) = DNI(t) * sum_i A_i * eta_i(t)
\end{verbatim}

\section{AI 工具使用说明}
本文使用生成式人工智能工具辅助完成了部分程序代码的编写与文字整理；模型构建、参数论证、结果检验与结论由作者完成并逐项复核。所有数值结果均由上述可复现的计算脚本直接生成。
